ins rating now counts as a win. Hovering a summon ability in card details now shows the summoned unit. Changes Display names are now unique. Tooltips list threat before health, like the card does. If the servers can't be reached at launch, you now get a Retry button. Balance Fractional damage now rounds up, so every hit deals at least 1. Fixes Fixed cards not following the mouse on ultrawide and other non-16:9 screens. Fixed a card v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041289","verified_at":"2026-10-25T10:22:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836460-1845383656387647","game_id":"steam-4836460","kind":"announcement","title":"A Cryptid to a Card","summary":"This is a peek behind the curtain, finding out what goes into creating a new card. We'll go from initial concept to implementation and fixing it after playtesting. Come find out a little bit of what goes into making a cryptid real. My name is Matt. I’m one of the engineers working to make this game the best it can be. My main job with the team, although since we’re small we all do a bit of everything, is to be the game’s designer. That means I work on making the game’s core mechanics and everyth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T20:31:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836460-1843481262693166","game_id":"steam-4836460","kind":"announcement","title":"Thanks for playing Portentum at PAX West","summary":"PAX West wrapped on Monday, and we're still catching up on sleep. Thank you to everyone who stopped by, sat down, and rolled some dice with us. It was the first time we'd shown Portentum to anyone outside the studio, and it went better than we'd hoped. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46245586/35201a232a6ebed63b48f6d21706e3f436eef6bd.jpg The stations at the booth. Every one of those PCs is playing offline. Seven stations, no internet We ran six or seven stations, depending on the day, and every one of them pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T18:41:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836460-1840310314339481","game_id":"steam-4836460","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Portentum: a cryptid deck-building auto battler","summary":"Portentum is a deck-building auto battler starring cryptids. You collect a deck of monsters, roll and manipulate dice to fire off their abilities, and watch your team auto-battle round after round. A yeti damaging the entire board with a blizzard. Meet the cryptidsCryptids are what broke us out on Fortnite. Hunt Bigfoot was the game that took Snowfall from zero to something, and Hunt TRex followed right behind it. Ever since, we've had players asking us for more cryptid games. So we built one wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T15:21:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4836460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4836460":"2026-10-26T04:44:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4836460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:57Z","status":"ok","e